<title>USA: Starwood Lodging Trust Q1 net, FFO rise.</title>
<headline>Starwood Lodging Trust Q1 net, FFO rise.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited; in thousands except per-share data)</p>
<p>					 1997	     1996</p>
<p>Revenues			  $ 172,719	$ 60,579</p>
<p>Funds From Operations (FFO) $  33,113	$ 13,125</p>
<p>FFO Per Share		   $    0.60	$   0.44</p>
<p>Net Income			$   7,786	$  4,090</p>
<p>Earnings Per Paired Share   $    0.18	$   0.20</p>
<p>Weighted Avg. Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>					  44,313	  20,697</p>
<p>Weighted Avg. LP Units and Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>					  55,172	  29,613</p>
<p>NOTE: The above results reflect the combined results of Starwood Lodging Trust, a hotel real estate investment trust, and Starwood Lodging Corp, a hotel management and operating company, whose shares are paired and trade together on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
